import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 846 | Transcended Ones and Art · Overview — The Transcended One's Artistic Creation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 846 | Transcended Ones and Art · Overview — The Transcended One's Artistic Creation","no":846,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Art","Civilizational Aesthetics","Creation","Consciousness Art"],"related":["26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle","37-Symbiotic Education System","761-Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Civilizational Engineering Overview","845-Fusion of Technological Civilization"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0846_模块4-超脱者与艺术-总论.md","filePath":"en/0846_模块4-超脱者与艺术-总论.md"}`),r={name:"en/0846_模块4-超脱者与艺术-总论.md"};function o(s,e,l,d,c,h){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-846-transcended-ones-and-art-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-artistic-creation" tabindex="-1">Entry 846 | Transcended Ones and Art · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Artistic Creation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-846-transcended-ones-and-art-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-artistic-creation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 846 | Transcended Ones and Art · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Artistic Creation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 26, 37, 761, 845</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-strongest-not-only-builds-he-must-also-know-beauty" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the strongest not only builds, he must also know beauty <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-strongest-not-only-builds-he-must-also-know-beauty" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the strongest not only builds, he must also know beauty&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the old worldview, art is the weak&#39;s pastime, the fallen country&#39;s extravagance. Strong ones are busy contending for hegemony, closed-door cultivation, killing; who has time to write poetry or paint? So the strongest civilizations are often the crudest — it may shatter planets, yet cannot paint a picture that calms people down. Heng Yuan Zhou corrects this: <strong>the true transcended one not only must build civilization well and lead Myriad Ranks well, but also must &quot;make civilization beautiful.&quot;</strong> Art is not the transcended one&#39;s leisure after work, but part of his post duty. This entry is the &quot;Transcended Ones and Art&quot; sub-theme overview, answering: why must the transcended one create art, and what is the essential difference between his art and the old world&#39;s &quot;imperial elegance.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires art serve and express Myriad Ranks, not become the strong ones&#39; private appreciation; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires art not be monopolized or treated as power-flaunting luxury; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires art elevate Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual realm, uplifting together with power; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires consciousness art not manipulate Myriad Ranks&#39; emotions; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires art&#39;s law mechanism be self-consistent, not written as a &quot;protagonist casually paints and divine signs appear&quot; golden finger.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-transcended-one-must-engage-in-art" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Transcended One Must Engage in Art <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-transcended-one-must-engage-in-art" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Transcended One Must Engage in Art&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Art in Heng Yuan Zhou is not decoration, but civilization&#39;s &quot;spiritual infrastructure.&quot; Three reasons:</p><ol><li><strong>Myriad Ranks not only want to live, but live with taste.</strong> If a civilization only manages cultivation and efficiency, Myriad Ranks dry up in endless evolution. Art gives evolution a sense of meaning — people do not live only to become stronger.</li><li><strong>Art is laws&#39; sensuous expression.</strong> The transcended one&#39;s deepest understanding of cosmic laws is often first &quot;seen&quot; in art form, then &quot;built&quot; in engineering form. Art is law creation&#39;s prelude.</li><li><strong>Art is Myriad Ranks&#39; emotions&#39; public outlet.</strong> Without art, Myriad Ranks&#39; suffering and joy, fear and hope have nowhere to be placed; easily exploited by short-cut inner demons and predatory rhetoric. Art is anti-predation&#39;s soft defense line.</li></ol><h2 id="ii-the-difference-between-transcended-one-art-and-imperial-elegance" tabindex="-1">II. The Difference Between Transcended-One Art and Imperial Elegance <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-difference-between-transcended-one-art-and-imperial-elegance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Difference Between Transcended-One Art and Imperial Elegance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world also has &quot;imperial elegance&quot; — emperors calligraphy, strong ones painting. But that and Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended-one art have an essential difference:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Imperial Elegance</th><th>Transcended-One Art</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Purpose</td><td>Flaunt power, adorn elegance</td><td>Serve Myriad Ranks, express axioms</td></tr><tr><td>Audience</td><td>Ministers gaze</td><td>Myriad Ranks share</td></tr><tr><td>Relationship</td><td>Art is power&#39;s decoration</td><td>Art is civilization&#39;s construction</td></tr><tr><td>Consequence</td><td>Art dies with the person</td><td>Art deposits into civilization, perpetual</td></tr></tbody></table><p>In one sentence: <strong>emperors use art to prove themselves great; the transcended one uses art to make Myriad Ranks great.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-artistic-creation-s-four-facets" tabindex="-1">III. Artistic Creation&#39;s Four Facets <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-artistic-creation-s-four-facets" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Artistic Creation&#39;s Four Facets&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This overview leads the following four facets:</p><ul><li><strong>Civilizational aesthetics</strong> (entry 847): the transcended one establishes the whole civilization&#39;s aesthetic standard — what is beautiful, what is crude;</li><li><strong>Epic creation</strong> (entry 848): use epics to write Myriad Ranks&#39; common memory and axioms into singable narrative;</li><li><strong>Music and consciousness art</strong> (entry 849): art directly acting on the consciousness domain, purifying heart-nature, nourishing Myriad Ranks;</li><li><strong>Architecture and spatial art</strong> (entry 850): solidify law aesthetics into physical space, letting Myriad Ranks live in beautiful environments.</li></ul><p>Four facets together, art upgrades from &quot;a few songs, a few paintings&quot; to <strong>aesthetics engineering permeating every corner of civilization.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-art-and-the-individual-collective-balance" tabindex="-1">IV. Art and the Individual-Collective Balance <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-art-and-the-individual-collective-balance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Art and the Individual-Collective Balance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Art has an internal tension: it is the most personal creation, yet must be Myriad Ranks&#39; shared public object. Document 26 Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle applies here:</p><ul><li>The transcended one does not &quot;stipulate&quot; what Myriad Ranks should like — art&#39;s aesthetic may not be autocratically decided by the strong;</li><li>But the transcended one must <strong>set an example</strong>: use the highest-level works to lift Myriad Ranks&#39; aesthetic upward;</li><li>Art&#39;s right of evaluation belongs to Myriad Ranks; the transcended one only &quot;makes beauty for everyone to see,&quot; not &quot;forces everyone to like it.&quot;</li></ul><p>This is the art dimension&#39;s Myriad-Rank republicanism: <strong>beauty may be led, may not be monopolized.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: deposit the transcended one&#39;s deep comprehension of laws through art into Myriad Ranks&#39; shareable spiritual wealth, not dissipating with the individual</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: art shared network-wide, not monopolized, sealing the path of &quot;treating beauty as power luxury&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones have no artistic pursuit; civilization only contends for hegemony; Heng Yuan Zhou lists art as the transcended one&#39;s legal duty</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: art faces all five-lineage beings, providing perceptible beauty for different life forms</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: artworks, aesthetic standards, and creation process open network-wide; part of hyper-multiverse-grade civilizational engineering</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-artistic-creation-s-post-metering" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Artistic Creation&#39;s Post Metering <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-artistic-creation-s-post-metering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Artistic Creation&#39;s Post Metering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Art in Heng Yuan Zhou is not amateur; it, like education and technology, is the transcended one&#39;s post, therefore also metered. If an artwork nourishes Myriad Ranks&#39; heart-nature, elevates civilizational aesthetics, and is widely recognized by Myriad Ranks, its creator receives corresponding civilizational weight; if the work only flaunts the individual and has nothing to do with Myriad Ranks, weight is extremely low. All consciousness-facing artworks&#39; creation and dissemination leave traces under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, preventing art from becoming a tool for manipulating hearts. Precisely because art is metered and guarded this way, the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm will not, while pursuing power, throw away beauty and warmth together.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s artistic creation answers &quot;for what is civilization strong?&quot; If strength only serves greater strength, civilization becomes a soulless machine; when the strongest personally makes beauty, sings epics, settles Myriad Ranks&#39; emotions, strength for the first time has warmth. Art is not the transcended one&#39;s leisure after work, but the softest yet most critical link in his post duty.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">Entry 26 · Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/37-共生教育体系.html">Entry 37 · Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/761_模块4-超多元级文明工程总论.html">Entry 761 · Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Civilizational Engineering Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/845_模块4-超脱者与科技-科技文明融合.html">Entry 845 · Fusion of Technological Civilization</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const p=t(r,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
